# Vercel deployment (Hobby / free)

- Host on **Vercel Hobby** — no paid features required for this static/marketing Next.js site.
- Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://cursornewzealand.co.nz` in Vercel project env vars (no trailing slash).
- Custom domain on Cloudflare DNS; add apex + www in Vercel → Domains (see `.cursor/skills/cloudflare-dns/SKILL.md`).
- Default build: `pnpm build`, output: Next.js (no custom config needed).
- GitHub repo: `aleibovici/cursor-new-zealand` (fork of `luisfer/cursor-ambassador-evergreen`).
- Events/calendar: Luma at `https://lu.ma/cursor-new-zealand`.
- Use Vercel MCP to inspect deployments and logs when builds fail.
- `@vercel/analytics` is already included; no extra analytics MCP needed at launch.
